sequenceDiagram
    actor Pegawai
    participant Frontend
    participant Server
    participant Storage
    participant Database
    
    Pegawai->>Frontend: Buka form Inisiasi Dokumen
    Pegawai->>Frontend: Pilih Template & Isi Judul Kegiatan
    Pegawai->>Frontend: Upload file lampiran (PDF)
    Frontend->>Storage: Upload to Supabase Storage
    Storage-->>Frontend: Return File URL
    Frontend->>Server: POST /api/dokumen (DRAFT -> IN_REVIEW)
    Server->>Database: INSERT INTO kegiatan & dokumen_transaksi
    Server->>Database: INSERT INTO log_aktivitas (aksi: SUBMIT)
    Database-->>Server: Success
    Server-->>Frontend: Dokumen masuk ke Inbox Atasan
